7d09c74bba5a7e00df60e60c67175dd6c7635aa0ee02af3dceff687b735"},"message":"feat(tactics): add scoped goals and descendant tactic sequencing\n\nImplement strict bullets, focus, all_goals, <;>, and parenthesized tactic\nsequences using heap-planned syntax and the existing proof worklist.\nPreserve dependent contexts, synthetic holes, sibling isolation, and\npending declaration-closing continuations. Invalid unused obligations\nremain kernel checks, and resource stops remain nonanswers.\n\nThirty-nine new regressions; locally reconciled five-package suite passes\n1947 top-level tests, with Clippy, formatting and workspace compilation.\nNo new kernel rules, axioms or dependencies. Preserve the concurrent typed\nproof-conversion implementation. Related workstream: fln-kpd.","examples":[["examples/native_goal_control.lean",12,8],["examples/native_tactic_sequencing.lean",12,8]]}
